<p>Push your heavy weapon beyond its normal limits to trigger a powerful effect. This will immediately disable your heavy weapon and expends all remaining ammunition.</p><p><span style="color: #7fffd4"><span class="tstr-color-AQUAMARINE">Flamethrower</span></span>: Detonate your fuel tanks, creating a radius 4 explosion that launches you to a chosen tile in range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 8, 9.</acronym> Enemies caught within the explosion take <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">172, 231, 277, 316, 351</acronym> fire damage, and further fire damage equal to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">50%, 73%, 91%, 106%, 120%</acronym> of their current burning damage from the volatile fuel.</p><p><span style="color: #7fffd4"><span class="tstr-color-AQUAMARINE">Shockstaff</span></span>: Drive your staff into the ground, discharging all remaining power to deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">150%, 183%, 209%, 230%, 250%</acronym> shockstaff damage as lightning in radius <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 4, 4.</acronym> Those struck will be knocked back <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5, 6, 7, 9, 10</acronym> tiles, and if they strike a wall they will emit a static pulse dealing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>steampower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> lightning damage in radius 1 and stunning them for 5 turns.</p><p><span style="color: #7fffd4"><span class="tstr-color-AQUAMARINE">Boltgun</span></span>: Overcharge your boltgun, firing a single deadly bolt dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">150%, 183%, 209%, 230%, 250%</acronym> steamgun damage as acid in a piercing line. For each negative physical, magical, or mental effect on the target, they take an additional <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 10%, 13%, 17%, 20%</acronym> damage (to a maximum of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">25%, 50%, 69%, 85%, 100%</acronym>) and the duration of each negative effect is increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 4, 4</acronym> turns.</p>